namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamSpringLibrary:StepSpring {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamSpring.h#DreamSpringLibrary:StepSpring
    src   "Advance a spring by DeltaTime; returns true while it is still moving."
    text  "按 DeltaTime 推进弹性，返回 true 表示弹性仍在运动。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpringParams {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamSpring.h#DreamSpringParams
    src   "A damped spring, the way UI motion libraries (CSS spring(), react-spring, Apple's) describe it:\nmass, stiffness, damping. There is no duration; the value moves toward its target and settles\nwhen both the distance and the velocity are under the rest thresholds. Because the state keeps\nits velocity, retargeting mid-flight is continuous -- the reason lyric players use springs."
    text  "阻尼弹簧，与UI动效库（CSS spring()、react-spring、Apple的）的描述方式一致：\n质量、刚度、阻尼。它没有时长；值会向目标移动，并在距离和速度都低于静止阈值时\n稳定下来。由于状态会保留速度，在运动途中重新设定目标也是连续的——这正是歌词播放器\n使用弹簧的原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpringParams:RestDistance {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamSpring.h#DreamSpringParams:RestDistance
    src   "Distance to the target under which the spring may come to rest."
    text  "弹性达到静止状态的距离阈值。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpringParams:RestVelocity {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamSpring.h#DreamSpringParams:RestVelocity
